    "itemBody": {
      "version": "1.0",
      "statement": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<p>Read the text. Then, complete the sentence.</p>\n<p><br/><em>Jasmine rushed to her room and laid the paper on her desk. For the next two hours, Jasmine tried to figure out what the words and symbols meant. She developed a chart and tried to match each symbol to a letter, then tried to make the words and phrases match the code. But nothing worked. She finally gave up in frustration because this situation was ridiculous! She stuffed the paper in her backpack to look at tomorrow.</em></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>How does Jasmine feel after working hard to solve the code? Choose two.</p>"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "image": {
              "url": "../alef-assessment-content/data/ccl/assessment/questions/2025/06/19/06/16/IMRBEQ9EW3.jpg",
              "zoom": true
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "instruction": null,
      "audio": null,
      "stemVideo": null,
      "stemImage": null,
      "shuffled": true,
      "columns": 2,
      "listType": "NONE",
      "allowTryAgain": false,
      "hasActiveVideoBreakpoint": false,
      "title": null,
      "subTitle": null,
      "video": null,
      "backgroundLayout": null,
      "splitContent": null,
      "timeSpentConfig": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "optionId": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>tired</p>"
            }
          ],
          "feedback": null
        },
        {
          "optionId": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>frustrated</p>"
            }
          ],
          "feedback": null
        },
        {
          "optionId": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>delighted</p>"
            }
          ],
          "feedback": null
        },
        {
          "optionId": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>confident</p>"
            }
          ],
          "feedback": null
        },
        {
          "optionId": 498,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>sad</p>"
            }
          ],
          "feedback": null
        },
        {
          "optionId": 619,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>scared</p>"
            }
          ],
          "feedback": null
        }
      ]
