        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<p>The value of each place is 10 times the value of the place to its right.  </p>\n<p>So, in number 3.882, the digit 8 in the tenths place is 10 times as much as 8 in the hundredths place.</p>\n<p>The value of each place is \\(1 over 10\\) of the value of the place to its left.</p>\n<p>So, in number 3.882, 8 in the hundredths place is \\(1 over 10\\)of 8 in the tenths place.</p>"
          },
